Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:49.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《夺宝奇兵4：水晶骷髅王国》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:20.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:23.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你们好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what you got under there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿  咱们赛一赛吗？ - 得了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, you want to race?    - Oh, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来吧!   - 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on!    - Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:42.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托了 - 来啊  来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please?    - Come on! Let's go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.55,0:02:05.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开快点  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go faster! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:19.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(原子咖啡馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:46.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(1957年  美国  内华达州)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:55.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:58.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为武器测试  整个地区在24小时内禁止通行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole area is closed for weapons testing for the next 24 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,包括所有基地的工作人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That includes all on-base personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:02.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 下午好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这对您也不例外 上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that goes for you,  too, Colonel, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五角大楼规定…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pentagon sent out revised ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(禁区  无权进入者格杀勿论)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:28.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(美国陆军  1B7731  仅供官方使用)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:38.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏联人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:42.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为对付他们很容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't gonna be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好汉不提当年勇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not as easy as it used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还不是最糟的一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we've been through worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？那最糟的是哪次？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:49.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昆茨堡那次  当时敌人比我们多一倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flensburg. There was twice as many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那时我们还年轻  - 我仍然很年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were younger.    - I still am young!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:53.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那次我们手上有枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:57.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手放下  真丢人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands down, will you? You're embarrassing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:59.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准能脱险  我赌五百块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet you 500 bucks we can get out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是赌一百吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's call it 100.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道这是哪儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You recognize building, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下死者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:33.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说去死吧  同志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant drop dead, comrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按住他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:42.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:56.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 在哪儿找到他们的？ - 墨西哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where was he found?    - In Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:59.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在夜里挖宝  找这些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were digging in the dirt, looking for this stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:07.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是本地人  是不是？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not from around here, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:12.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  你不会想知道我是哪里人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it you would imagine I am from, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据你那副不可一世的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the way you're sinking your  teeth into those wubble-u's,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:18.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你是来自乌克兰东部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should think maybe Eastern Ukraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:20.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高的评价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Highest marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:22.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是艾琳娜·史波可博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Dr. Irina Spalko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:27.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我获得过列宁勋章 三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three times I have received Order of Lenin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:32.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及英雄的社会主义劳动者奖章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also medal as Hero of Socialist Labor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我无所不知  我知人所未知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I know things. I know them before anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:43.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且若我不知  我会查出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what I do not know, I find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:49.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我现在想知道的  就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what I need to know now is in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:08.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 琼斯博士  你很难感知嘛  - 好痛呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are a hard man to read, Dr. Jones.    - Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:13.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们只好按老规矩办事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we will do this, what is  expression, old-fashioned way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.61,0:07:17.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样你就会帮我们找到想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will tell us. You will help us find what we seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把门打开{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:44.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这间仓库就是你们政府存放所有秘密的地方吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This warehouse is where you  and your government have hidden all of your secrets, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:48.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是间军用仓库 我此前从没来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a military warehouse. I've never been here before in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找的东西装在长方形盒子内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Object we seek, rectangular storage container,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,盒子长2米 宽0.5米 厚66厘米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dimensions 2 meters by 0.5 meter by 66 centimeters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:59.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,里面装的是具遗骸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contents of box, mummified remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道不知此事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no doubt familiar to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:05.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么认为我会知道？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I've got any idea what box you're talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:07.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在十年前...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because 10 years ago ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你带领小组找到它的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were part of the team that examined it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:15.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:19.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你说的是什么了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if I knew  what you were talking about ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:22.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要帮我们找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will help us find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指南针 我需要个指南针{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compass. I need a compass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:38.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是用来指北 南 东...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, north, south, east West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:39.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, north, south, east West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:43.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没指南针吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No compass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的子弹给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈 他要我把枪给他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:57.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个盒子有极高的磁性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The contents of that box are highly magnetized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我火药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need gunpowder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:02.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想不想要我帮你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want my help or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:19.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别和我耍花招  琼斯博士  你到底在搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't toy with me, Dr. Jones. What is the point of all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:21.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果那盒子依然具有磁性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's still magnetic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:24.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这火药中的铁屑会指引方向的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the metal in this gunpowder should point the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:53.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这边走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.73,0:09:57.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弹壳  给我些散弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shells. Give me some shotgun shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同志们 找到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来几个人把它抬出来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:54.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿  小心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:11:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用力  小心  稳住  稳住{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:04.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(新墨西哥州 罗斯威尔  1947年  编号RSW001)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我把刀{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刀 给您{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:11.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于找到了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:24.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪都放下! 不然史波可博士就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the guns, or Colonel Dr. Spalko is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mac?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:49.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯  要我怎么说呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what can I say, Jonesey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:53.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我信奉资本主义  而他们出价不低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a capitalist, and they pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:57.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年来  我们同甘共苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all those years we spent spying on the Reds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:02.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为我们是朋友呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were friends, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:05.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是我不幸被他们抓住的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had a run of bad luck with the cards lately, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可怕  太他妈可怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awful. Bloody awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:12.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再两手空空地回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go home empty-handed again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:16.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  想好遗言了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No defiant last words, Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我热爱考古{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like Ike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:22.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put down gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:24.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下就放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死  就差一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, I thought that was closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:14:59.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊  来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能活着离开这儿  派人去截住他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了  鲍里斯  你不了解情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get clever, Boris. You don't know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:29.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know him. Know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没搞清楚  你不了解他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know him! You don't know him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:34.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不了解他  你不了解他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know him!  You don't know ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你干得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:12.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意儿酷极了!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:58.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我过敲门了  你们…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I knocked.  You guys got a ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that can't be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人注意  一分钟内撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, it is now one minute to zero time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:43.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴好墨镜  向相反方向撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on goggles or turn away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在第一次闪光后十秒内  不要摘掉墨镜回头看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not remove goggles or face burst until 10 seconds after first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大事不妙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That can't be good at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:58.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撤退 我们快走!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:02.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait!  Wait, wait, wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.21,0:20:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好  他妈的  不等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure! Great! Don't wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:09.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,15秒倒计时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minus 15 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,10秒倒计时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minus 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,九 八 七 六{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Niner, eight, seven, six,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:30.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五 四{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fiver, four,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:34.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三 二 一 发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three, two, one, zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:08.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的不知道麦克是间谍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no reason to believe that Mac was a spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为战略情报局工作时 他为军情六处工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was Ml6 when I was in OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在欧洲和太平洋地区  我们合作过二三十次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did 20, 30 missions together in Europe and the Pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别在我们面前显摆你的功绩了  琼斯上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't wave your war record in our face, Colonel Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:18.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都曾为国效力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all served.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思？你们站在那一边的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No kidding?  What side were you on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:23.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你已经认识到局势的严重性了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you recognize the gravity of your situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:29.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚协助克格勃特务侵入了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aided and abetted KGB agents who broke into a top-secret  military installation ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:32.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们国家中部的秘密军事基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the United States of America, my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:35.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被窃的那个钢盒里是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was in the steel box they took?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.36,0:22:38.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个应该你告诉我们  你以前见过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell us. You've seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.54,0:22:45.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指47年的那次任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean that Air Force fiasco in '47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我被塞进一辆密不透风的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was tossed into a bus with blacked-out windows ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:52.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不许和同车的20人说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and 20 people I wasn't allowed to speak to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,半夜出发去执行紧急挖掘任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hauled out in the middle of the  night in the middle of nowhere ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道去哪儿  而又能看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on some urgent recovery project and shown what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:03.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无遮掩的具有强磁性的碎片  还有不同寻常的遗迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pieces of wreckage and an intensely magnetic shroud covering mutilated remains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:06.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们谁都不知道那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of us was ever given the full picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并被威胁如果和任何人说起 就会被处以叛国罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we were threatened with treason if we ever talked about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:10.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以应该是你们告诉我  那盒子里到底装的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you tell me,  what was in the box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:12.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第  谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:14.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道躲在冰箱里有多危险吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know it's dangerous to climb into a refrigerator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:16.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西可能正是陷阱呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those things can be deathtraps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:19.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真好  鲍勃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, too, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:21.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松  伙计们  我来和琼斯博士谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, boys.  I can vouch for Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:23.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:26.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克格勃跑到美国本土来了  那女人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KGB on American soil? Who is that woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:28.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,描述一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Describe her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.29,0:23:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又高又瘦  三十多岁  还带着把破剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tall, thin, mid-30s, carried a sword of some kind, a rapier, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:38.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:39.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定她在此地？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure she's here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:42.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来了又走了  她是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here and gone. Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.39,0:23:45.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾琳娜·史波可  她是斯大林的干女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina Spalko, she was Stalin's fair-haired girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:49.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是著名科学家  如果通灵术也算是科学的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His favorite scientist, if you  can call psychic research science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:51.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯将军…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Ross ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她率领队伍转战世界各地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's leading teams from the  Kremlin all over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:57.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四处搜集她认为有军事价值的古物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scooping up artifacts she thinks might have paranormal military applications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.53,0:24:00.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 罗斯将军  - 闭嘴  保罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- General Ross!    - Back off, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.57,0:24:04.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是每个人都是共产党间谍   印第更不会是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everyone in the Army's a Commie and certainly not Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了没被核弹炸死外  对我还有什么指控吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly am I being accused of, besides surviving a nuclear blast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:09.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目前还没有指控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:11.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但老实说  鉴于你同乔治·麦克希尔的关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But frankly your association with George McHale ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:16.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使你在二战时的行为有些可疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes all your activities suspicious, including those during the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:18.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:21.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道这帮杂种还要多少这样的金属吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how many medals this son of a bitch won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:23.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定不少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great many, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:27.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们受之有愧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But does he deserve them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.39,0:24:31.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯博士  你现在对政府很重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Jones, let's just say for now that you are of interest to the Bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:33.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至关重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of great interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:45.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同样的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grooved Ware in the beginning of modern drainage practices,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.37,0:24:48.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在苏格兰斯卡拉布雷遗址也被发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which we also see in Skara Brae on the west coast of Scotland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该遗址可以追溯到公元前3100年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skara Brae dates from 3100 B.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:54.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六百年来 它一直被占领着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was continuously occupied for 600 years ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直至公元前2500年被遗弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until it was apparently abandoned in 2500 B.C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:59.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还没有令人信服的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no clear evidence as to why its occupants ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.59,0:25:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,表明为何占领者决定放弃一个完美的生存环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decided to abandon a perfectly  healthy environment. Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.51,0:25:07.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 能打扰一下吗  教授？ - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May I have a moment, Professor?    - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:10.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开书  复习第四章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open up Michaelson.  Review Chapter 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.56,0:25:14.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿我回来后  我们讨论迁徙和"出埃及"的不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I come back we'll discuss the difference between migration and exodus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.86,0:25:22.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:25.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  学校董事会不停施压{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea the pressure coming from the Board of Regents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:27.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局今早来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The FBI showed up this morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:29.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜遍了你的办公室  查抄了所有文件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ransacked your office, searched all your files!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.79,0:25:31.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是在学校啊  你怎么不阻止他们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the dean of the college. Why didn't you stop them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.71,0:25:32.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没这个权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have no right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.04,0:25:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完全有这个权利  他们是群畜生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had every right! They weren't vandals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:37.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是带着搜查令的特务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were federal agents with search warrants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.05,0:25:41.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,学校不会冒险卷入此类麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The university isn't gonna get itself embroiled in that kind of controversy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.59,0:25:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种情况更不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not in this charged climate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这就是要开除我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're firing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:51.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是让你暂时离职  没别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A leave of absence is all. An indefinite leave of absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是开除  - 此间...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are firing me.    - During which ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.27,0:25:56.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还会付你全额的工资…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they've agreed to continue to pay your full salary for a period ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.19,0:25:57.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要他们的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want their money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.73,0:26:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你别犯傻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't be foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.32,0:26:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我费了多大劲才给你争取到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what I had to go  through to get that for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.32,0:26:05.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还费劲儿？你又能费什么劲  查理？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You went through? What exactly did you have to go through, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:07.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我辞职了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I resigned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.75,0:26:20.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.88,0:26:25.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先去纽约  明早去伦敦  重新开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Train to New York, overnight to London, for starts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:30.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我不去莱比锡大学呢？他们的校长欠我人情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might end up teaching in Leipzig. Heinrich owes me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.06,0:26:32.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等我定居下来 我就给你写信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wire you when I get settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:34.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你再把剩下的东西给我寄过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can send on the rest of my things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:36.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那时东西早被搜光了  都不用寄了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose there's nothing to keep you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.56,0:26:38.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个国家已经面目全非了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I barely recognize  this country anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.61,0:26:41.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,政府总是怀疑我们是共产党{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The government's got us seeing Communists in our soup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.78,0:26:46.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当疯狂战胜科学时  换换工作也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the hysteria reaches academia, I guess it's time to call it a career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:48.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迪尔丽德怎么受得了呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did Deirdre take the news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.53,0:26:50.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妻子通常都是怎么接受的呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does any wife take such things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.91,0:26:54.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着丈夫的脸  混杂着自豪与惊恐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The look on her face was  a combination of pride and panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:26:57.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该怀疑你的  我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never should've doubted you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.21,0:27:00.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  这几天你怀疑朋友也可以理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you have reason to question your friends these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.55,0:27:08.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过了好几年了  查理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brutal couple of years, huh, Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.97,0:27:12.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先是爸爸  然后是马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First Dad, then Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.73,0:27:18.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到年纪啦  生活不再给予而是开始带走我们的挚爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We seem to have reached the age where life stops giving us things and starts taking them away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.57,0:27:23.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再喝半杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just another half glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.92,0:28:23.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:26.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  老头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, old man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:31.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 教授 喂 你是琼斯博士吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor, hello! Hey! Are you Dr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火车快出站了  孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're running out of platform, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是奥克斯利教授的朋友吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a friend of Dr. Oxley's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.93,0:28:38.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是那个考古学家哈洛德·奥克斯利吗？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Harold Oxley? The archeologist?    - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.39,0:28:39.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.98,0:28:42.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他有生命危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:47.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有20年没同他说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't talked to Harold Oxley in 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:51.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个出色的学者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a brilliant guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:54.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是那种能把你说得昏昏欲睡的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could put you to sleep just by talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  很多孩子听他说话都会睡着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. When I was a kid, that's how I did get to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.70,0:29:01.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的声音比牛奶还催眠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxley's voice was better than a glass of warm milk, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.71,0:29:03.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫马特·威廉姆斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name's Mutt, Mutt Williams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.75,0:29:06.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马特？怎么取这个名字？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutt? What kind of name is that? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:09.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋  你找揍吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the one I picked. You got a problem with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.13,0:29:13.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松点儿  你和奥力克斯博士有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy. What was your relationship to Oxley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.51,0:29:18.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爹死于二战  他帮助我妈抚养我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad died in the war. Ox kind of helped my mom raise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.10,0:29:21.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是有人要取他性命？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were saying somebody's going to kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.73,0:29:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,6个月前  我妈收到奥克斯的来信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six months ago, my mom gets a letter from the Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.15,0:29:28.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说他在秘鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's down in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.69,0:29:31.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了什么骷髅头  水晶骷髅头骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found some type of skull, a crystal skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.49,0:29:35.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个叫米切尔-哈提基思什么的人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the one that guy Mitchell-Hodgkiss? Hedgkiss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:37.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是他发现的那个  - 外套不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The one he found.    - Nice jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:42.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大学里只有奥克斯和我研究水晶骷髅头骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ox and I were obsessed with the Mitchell-Hedges skull in college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:44.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道这个？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.29,0:29:45.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢？他成天只说这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding?  It's all he talked about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.67,0:29:47.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一回家就说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd talk about that thing till the cows come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.55,0:29:49.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个神秘雕像吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it? It's like an idol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.55,0:29:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做工精美  在美洲中部被发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deity carving. Mesoamerican.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.43,0:29:54.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世界上有很多水晶骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a number of crystal skulls in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在大英博物馆见过一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw one in the British Museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:30:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣的水晶赝品  没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting craftsmanship, but that's about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.43,0:30:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们等会再谈那个  奥克斯说这次他找到真的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, laugh if you want. Oxley said he found it this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.35,0:30:08.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且要将其还于埃克托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said this was real and he was off to a place called Akator with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.40,0:30:11.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 埃克托？你确定他是这么说的吗？ - 我确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Akator? He said that? You're sure? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.24,0:30:14.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你刚说的一样  你说埃克托  那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he said. He said Akator. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.99,0:30:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是亚马孙河流域传说中的失落之城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mythical lost city  in the Amazon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:21.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,西班牙探险者称之为"黄金国"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conquistadors called it El Dorado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.75,0:30:25.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据说是神选的布伽族人在七千年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposedly, the Ugha tribe were chosen by the gods 7,000 years ago ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:29.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以实心金砖建造的巨大的城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to build a giant city  out of solid gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.75,0:30:32.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其建筑的工艺水平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had aqueducts and paved roads ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.42,0:30:37.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,建造技术在之后五千年内再未出现过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and technology that wouldn't  be seen again for 5,000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:42.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗西斯科·尤里奥纳于1546年到亚马逊探索该城未果而失踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Francisco de Orellana disappeared into the Amazon looking for it in 1546.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.60,0:30:46.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾试图寻找它  但险些丧命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost died of typhus looking for it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.11,0:30:49.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信它存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.57,0:30:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么奥克斯要把骷髅头带到那去？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would Ox want to take the skull there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.53,0:30:58.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据传说 骷髅头于15或16世纪时被人从埃克托窃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The legend says that a crystal  skull was stolen from Akator in the 15th or 16th century,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.45,0:31:02.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论谁 若能将它归还城市神庙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that whoever returns  the skull to the city temple ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.16,0:31:04.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,作为报答将会掌控某种力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be given control over its power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,力量？关系到了某种力量 是什么样的力量？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power. Right. So there's some kind of power. What's the power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:11.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  孩子  只是个传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, kid.  It's just a story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.55,0:31:12.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.59,0:31:16.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈收到奥克斯的信之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From his letter, my mom thought the Ox was off his rocker. You know, smog in the noggin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.93,0:31:20.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她就去找他  而他已经被绑架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she goes down there to find him, only he'd already been kidnapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.31,0:31:22.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们也抓住了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they've got her, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:23.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯说他们在某个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Ox said he hid that skull someplace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.68,0:31:26.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈要是不能提供有用的信息  他们两人都会没命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if my mom doesn't come up with it, they're gonna kill them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.02,0:31:29.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说你能帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, she said you'd help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:32.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我？令堂的名字是？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? What's your mom's name again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.15,0:31:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽安·威廉姆斯  你还记得她吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary. Mary Williams. You remember her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.99,0:31:36.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识许多叫玛丽安的人  孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were a lot of Marys, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.32,0:31:38.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住口  你说的可是我老妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! That's my mother you're talking about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:40.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我母亲  好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? That's my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.41,0:31:43.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不必拍桌子瞪眼的  来让自己显得像个硬汉吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to get sore all the  time just to prove how tough you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.49,0:31:45.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下  请坐下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down. Please. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:49.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说你能找到骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said if anybody could find  the skull, it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:54.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个…盗墓贼什么的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you're some type of ... Like a grave robber or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.67,0:31:57.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是考古学的终身教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a tenured professor of archeology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.59,0:32:01.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  你是老师  那就更能帮我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're a teacher. Well, that's gonna be a big help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.93,0:32:03.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  我妈两周前从南美打电话给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, she called me two weeks ago from South America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:06.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说她逃出来了  他们在追她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said she'd escaped, but they were after her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.60,0:32:08.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她有封奥克斯转给你的信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she'd just gotten a letter from the Ox ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.35,0:32:10.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我转交给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and mailed it to me so I could give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.44,0:32:11.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电话就断了  我拆开看了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the line went dead.  I opened it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:14.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但看不懂  乱码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the thing's pointless,  though. It's just gibberish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:16.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都不是用英文写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not even English lettering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:18.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.91,0:32:23.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到那两个盯梢的了吧？ 在桌旁的那两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See those two bricks over there, at the counter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.33,0:32:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可不是来喝奶昔的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think they're here for the milkshakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.00,0:32:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:31.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  可能是调查局的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know. Maybe FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.29,0:32:33.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别轻举妄动  琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come quietly, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.13,0:32:34.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这说明他们是克格勃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make that KGB.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.63,0:32:37.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把信交出来  - 信？什么信？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And bring letter with you.    - Letter? What letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.80,0:32:39.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是威廉姆斯先生刚给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letter Mr. Williams just give you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.22,0:32:41.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我？我看起来像个邮递员吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? Do I look like a mailman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.22,0:32:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会再说一次了  现在就跟我们走 不然…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't ask again. Come now or we'll ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.05,0:32:44.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不然怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:51.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不错的尝试 孩子  但我看你是带了把刀去参加枪战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try, kid, but I think  you just brought a knife to a gunfight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.23,0:32:52.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:58.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 揍这小子  - 揍谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hit this guy.    - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:33:00.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正要结帐出去这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe College. Hit him hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.11,0:33:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好啊  - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, hold this.    - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.07,0:33:04.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我男朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my boyfriend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,揍这帮飚车党{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that greaser!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.47,0:33:20.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你妈逃出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom didn't escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.97,0:33:23.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是他们放了她  好让她把信寄给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They let her go, so she could mail the letter ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.85,0:33:27.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后让你把信给我  我就可以破译它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you could bring it to me and I could translate it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.12,0:33:29.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 他们要跑了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.27,0:33:31.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on, gramps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.55,0:34:01.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 快! 快! 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.52,0:34:04.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他  抓住他{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.86,0:34:47.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他拐弯了  跟上{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.85,0:34:57.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.75,0:35:08.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在那儿 跟上{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:24.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宁死不红 宁死不红{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better dead than Red! Better dead than Red!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.05,0:35:29.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是疯了 有人会受伤的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy! Somebody's going to get hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.86,0:35:40.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(马库斯·布鲁迪)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:55.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿  跟上他们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.54,0:35:59.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向左拐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left! Go left! Left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.39,0:36:16.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让开  让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.89,0:36:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪开 闪开 闪开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Split, split! Split, split!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.27,0:36:20.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们开得太快了  - 只有你觉得快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're going too fast.    - That's a matter of opinion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.83,0:36:36.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打扰一下  琼斯博士  - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me, Dr. Jones.    - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于哈格罗伍的文化图腾  我有个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just had a question on Hargrove's normative culture model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.17,0:36:41.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是算了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget Hargrove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.63,0:36:44.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去查阅范戈登·蔡尔德的著作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read Vere Gordon Childe on diffusionism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.80,0:36:46.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这个领域钻研了一辈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spent most of his life  in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.97,0:36:50.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若想成为个优秀的考古学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to be  a good archeologist,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.09,0:36:54.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就得走出图书馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you got to get out of the library!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.44,0:37:00.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:03.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗西斯科·迪·尤里奥纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Francisco de Orellana, the conquistador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.77,0:37:06.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾说过他在寻找骷髅头时失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, the guy who got lost looking for the skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.11,0:37:09.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正如我所猜测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just as I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.70,0:37:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"科尤玛"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koihoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.78,0:37:13.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.32,0:37:18.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是种失传的拉丁美洲语言  索拉比克语的语源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an extinct Latin American language. Pre-Columbian syllabic base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.58,0:37:23.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看 虽然字体不同  但线条差不多  绝对是科尤玛语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See. Diagonal stresses on the  ideograms. Definitely Koihoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.71,0:37:25.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会说这种语言吗？ - 没人会说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You speak it?    - Nobody speaks it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.67,0:37:29.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,3千年来  听到这种语言的人都不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hasn't been heard aloud in 3,000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.09,0:37:33.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我能看懂一点  不过得先复习一下玛雅语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to read a bit though if I walk it through Mayan first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.18,0:37:36.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于一个老家伙来说  你打架一点都不逊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, for an old man, you ain't bad in a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.72,0:37:38.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢夸奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有八十岁了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, like, 80?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.90,0:37:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个谜语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a riddle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.15,0:37:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很符合奥克斯的风格  用消亡了的语言写成谜语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it to Ox to write a riddle in a dead language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.20,0:37:55.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"跟随地球上那条只有上帝才能看到的线"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Follow the lines in the earth only gods can read ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.37,0:38:00.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"指引你找到有活死人守护着的尤里奥纳的摇篮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"which lead to Orellana's cradle guarded by the living dead."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.87,0:38:03.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他说的是纳兹卡线  - 什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's talking about the Nazca Lines.    - What are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.87,0:38:05.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.00,0:38:12.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巨大而古老的地表图画雕刻在秘鲁沙漠的地面上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geoglyphs. Giant ancient drawings carved into the desert floor in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.55,0:38:15.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在地上看是看不出什么名堂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the ground, they don't look like anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.39,0:38:19.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是从空中 只有上帝可懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But from the sky, only the gods can read them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.10,0:38:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为只有上帝高高在上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because only gods live up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.89,0:38:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯利想告诉我们  骷髅就在秘鲁的纳兹卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxley's telling us the skull is in Nazca, Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.96,0:39:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于知道有人看见过他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally. They saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.17,0:39:36.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯几个月前来过  像个疯子似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox wandered into town a couple of  months ago, raving like a madman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.13,0:39:38.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察把他关进修道院  走这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police locked him up  in the sanitarium. It's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.64,0:39:41.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说的西班牙语  我一个字都不懂  那到底是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took Spanish and I didn't understand a word of that. What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.14,0:39:43.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"卡图瓦"  当地土话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quechua, local Incan dialect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.43,0:39:46.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么学会的？ - 说来话长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you learn that one?    - Long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.10,0:39:47.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有的是时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.77,0:39:50.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和"庞驰·维拉"待过  他的手下会这种话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rode with Pancho Villa. A couple of his guys spoke it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.27,0:39:51.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扯谈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.02,0:39:54.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你问我的  - 庞驰·维拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You asked.    - Pancho Villa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:57.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 实际上  我是被绑架去的  - 被庞驰·维拉的人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Technically, I was kidnapped.    - By Pancho Villa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.61,0:40:01.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在与维克多瑞亚·胡塔的交战中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the fight against Victoriano Huerta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.16,0:40:03.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那时你多大？ - 那时我就你这么大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How old were you?    - About your age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.45,0:40:05.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父母肯定急疯了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents must've had a cow, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.04,0:40:08.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时和家人的关系有点紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked out. Things were a little tense at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.29,0:40:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和老妈相处得也不是很融洽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, me and my mom aren't on the best of terms, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.25,0:40:13.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  要知道你只会有一个妈  而且也不能陪你一生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treat her right, kid. You only get  one and sometimes not for that long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.80,0:40:15.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不是我的错  是她的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault. It's hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.17,0:40:16.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她勃然大怒  因为我退学了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just got P.O.'ed because I quit school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:18.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她以为我是个一事无成的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks I'm some  kind of goof or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.47,0:40:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你退学了？ - 没错  还不只一次呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You quit school?    - Oh, yeah. Sure. Tons of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.76,0:40:24.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在几所有名的预科学校读过书 学辩论  国际象棋  剑术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fancy prep schools that teach you how to debate and chess and fencing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.77,0:40:26.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不相信什么学位呢  那只是浪费时间而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm great with the blade. I just think it's a waste of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.02,0:40:29.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你从没读完  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You never finished.    - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:31.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只学了一些无用的技能罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a bunch of useless skills. Wrong books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.90,0:40:34.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我喜欢阅读  我过去整天都看书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I love reading. Me and Ox used to read all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.36,0:40:36.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我能证明自己了  相信吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I can pick them myself. You get me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.86,0:40:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你从哪儿来的钱？ - 参加摩托车赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you do for money?    - Fix motorcycles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:42.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一辈子都准备干这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna do that for the rest of your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.37,0:40:44.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我会的  你觉得不好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I will, Teach. You got a problem with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  只要是你喜欢做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not if that's  what you love doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.54,0:40:50.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就别管别人怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let anybody tell you different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.50,0:40:52.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it. Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.19,0:41:15.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说奥克斯原来就在儿  现在不知去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says Ox isn't here. She doesn't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.78,0:41:20.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人来抓走了他   一些拿着枪的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some men came and took him away, men with guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.08,0:41:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说他着魔了  神经错乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says he was obsessed, deranged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.08,0:41:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把监牢的墙上画满图片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drew pictures all over the walls of his cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.75,0:41:38.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯信中的谜语一点道理都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This riddle in Oxley's letter doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.26,0:41:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"跟随只有上帝才能看见的线"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Follow the lines that only the gods can read "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:43.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"它会引领你到尤里奥纳的摇篮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}" that lead to Orellana's cradle. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.01,0:41:46.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摇篮  他的出生地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cradle, cradle, birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.39,0:41:49.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尤里奥纳不是生于秘鲁  而是在西班牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orellana wasn't born in Peru. He was born in Spain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.48,0:41:51.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是探险者  来这儿是为了黄金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a conquistador. He came here for the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:52.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他后来怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.98,0:41:57.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他和其它六名队员  活不见人死不见尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He disappeared along with six others. Their bodies were never found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.47,0:42:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have lost his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.31,0:42:39.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生了什么？奥克斯到底怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, man, what happened? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.41,0:42:49.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个不是米切尔·哈提斯基的骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the Mitchell-Hedges skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.62,0:42:51.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看  后脑线条较长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the elongated cranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.75,0:42:57.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用不同的语言一遍遍写着相同的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the same word in different languages, over and over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.20,0:42:59.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,归还   回归{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.51,0:43:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回返{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.34,0:43:05.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,返回哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.18,0:43:07.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者归还什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or return what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.30,0:43:09.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是骷髅头？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the skull?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.89,0:43:12.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萦绕在他脑海中的事物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems to have been on his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.52,0:43:15.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很可能是那东西该归还给谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was he supposed to return it to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:29.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 扫干净  - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sweep.    - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.75,0:43:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯说的不是尤里奥纳的出生地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox didn't mean Orellana's birthplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.50,0:43:43.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"摇篮"在玛雅语中还有另一个意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cradle has another meaning in Mayan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.01,0:43:48.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直译为安息地  和坟墓是一个意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally, it means "resting place," as in final resting place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.05,0:43:51.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯是说  尤里奥纳的墓地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox meant Orellana's grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.56,0:43:56.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿了  他就埋葬于此处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This drawing scratched into the floor is the cemetery where he's buried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.06,0:43:59.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过尤里奥纳蒸发了  没人找到过他的坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said Orellana vanished and nobody ever found his grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.73,0:44:03.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来老奥克斯利找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it looks like Harold Oxley did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.43,0:44:36.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,盗墓贼会大吃一惊的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Grave robbers will be shot."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:38.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好在我们不是盗墓贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing we're not grave robbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.53,0:44:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们要找什么？ - 还不知道呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are we looking for?    - I don't know yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.24,0:44:53.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是这众多墓穴中的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe an antechamber off one of these barrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.47,0:45:11.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才好像看见什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I just saw something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.14,0:45:13.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是疑神疑鬼啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're jumping at shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.10,0:45:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这儿下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.90,0:45:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 从这儿上来  - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This way up.    - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.80,0:45:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,镖上有毒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those darts are poison!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.39,0:46:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待着别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.29,0:46:27.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是老师？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a teacher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.13,0:46:30.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,兼职的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Part-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.47,0:46:41.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死路一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.89,0:46:45.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.78,0:46:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛？放下那东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Put that thing away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.11,0:46:55.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我照亮点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some light over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.50,0:47:03.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.25,0:47:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.07,0:48:13.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你胆子好小  一惊一乍的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dance on your own dime, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.69,0:48:15.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才被蝎子叮了一下  不会没命吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the scorpions just stung me! Am I gonna die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.82,0:48:17.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 多大一只？ - 巨大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How big?    - Huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.03,0:48:19.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好  - 这还好？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good.    - Good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.03,0:48:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说到蝎子  越大毒性越小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it comes to scorpions, the bigger the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.99,0:48:27.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是小蝎子咬了你  就一定要告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A small one bites you, don't keep it to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.27,0:48:52.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,骷髅  看这些骷髅  老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their skulls.  Look at their skulls, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.48,0:48:56.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和牢房墙上画的如出一辙  说明离得不远了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the drawings in Oxley's cell. Means we're getting closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.19,0:48:58.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真疯狂  头骨怎么会变成这形状{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's crazy. Why is it like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.36,0:49:01.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当地土人用布条缠绑婴儿的头部  使颅骨变形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nazca Indians used to bind their infants' heads with rope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.87,0:49:03.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成了现在这模样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to elongate the skull like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.58,0:49:06.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么？ - 敬奉诸神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why?    - Honor the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.29,0:49:09.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  神灵的脑袋长得可不像这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.  God's head is not like that, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.62,0:49:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁又知道神长啥样呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Depends on who your god is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.80,0:49:23.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道去哪  还走这么快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going nowhere fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.85,0:49:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教授  这儿真的是死路一条啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor, this really is a dead end. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.53,0:49:39.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.84,0:49:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来吧  天才 把背包给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, genius.  Bring the backpack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.52,0:50:20.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太难以置信了  - 真的假的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is incredible.    - Unreal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.11,0:50:25.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都别乱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.20,0:50:30.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脚印  有人来过这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Footprints. Somebody's been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.16,0:50:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.67,0:50:38.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有两种脚印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two sets of prints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.76,0:50:43.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看大小  也许同一个人来了两回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same size, could have been the same person twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.63,0:50:45.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说的不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.14,0:50:56.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One. Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.86,0:51:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三 四 五 六{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three. Four. Five. Six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.99,0:51:03.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,七{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.07,0:51:08.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尤里奥纳和他的人看来根本就没到达雨林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orellana and his men might've made it out of the jungle after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.54,0:51:12.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,照亮一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.50,0:51:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你随身带着刀 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have a knife, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.19,0:51:45.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像昨天才死的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he just died yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.07,0:51:48.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,裹尸布让他们保存完好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the wrappings.  They preserved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.42,0:51:58.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What just happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.54,0:52:02.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被包裹了500年  接触空气可不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been wrapped up for 500 years. Air doesn't agree with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.18,0:52:11.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.89,0:52:17.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想借这把刀去使使已经好多年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to keep borrowing yours all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.85,0:52:20.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这没什么  - 还是还给他吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's fine.    - I was going to put it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.57,0:52:28.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这具尸骸也被人打开了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this one open already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.67,0:52:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.34,0:52:52.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是尤里奥纳本人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Orellana himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.56,0:53:02.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,散发着金子般光芒的男人  因传说中的黄金而失去踪影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called him The Gilded Man. His lust for gold was legendary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.61,0:53:04.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不幸啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.74,0:53:10.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人来了又走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's been here and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.24,0:53:16.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但黄金  所有器物还在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they left all this gold and all the artifacts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.33,0:53:20.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要找的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were they looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.64,0:53:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拿着  - 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold this.    - No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.87,0:53:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.80,0:54:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼斧神工  浑然天成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tool marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.71,0:54:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由一块材料雕刻而成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single piece of seamless quartz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.13,0:54:15.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把大脑分成两个半球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut across the grain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.85,0:54:19.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使今日的科技也无法做到这点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not possible, even with today's technology, it would shatter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.48,0:54:28.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水晶没有磁性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crystal's not magnetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.61,0:54:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是金子做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither is gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.07,0:54:36.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.83,0:54:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许当地土人认为这就是他们的神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the Nazca Indians thought this was their god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.04,0:54:43.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你认为这个就是从…  - 埃克托城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think this is the one from ...    - From Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.55,0:54:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这些西班牙佬发现了骷髅头和其它的珍宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the Spaniards found this skull along with all this other loot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.22,0:54:56.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,便朝海边的舰队走去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were headed for their ships along the shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.05,0:55:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许印第安人发现并杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the Indians  caught up with them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.10,0:55:03.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者西班牙人起了内讧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or they got to squabbling amongst themselves ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.73,0:55:07.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相互残杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over their prize,  kill each other off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.27,0:55:10.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安人将他们包裹安葬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Indians wrap them up and bury them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.61,0:55:15.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几百年后  奥克斯利来到此处找到骷髅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple of hundred years later, Oxley shows up here, finds the skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.78,0:55:19.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将其带走 也许带到了埃克托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takes it away, maybe to Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.08,0:55:24.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他随即又返回了此地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then he returns it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.66,0:55:26.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,返回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.46,0:55:29.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"返回" 和监牢墙上的字是一个意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return, like he wrote on the walls of his cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.42,0:55:34.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他将此物归还  为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He put it back  where he found it. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.62,0:56:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好啊 琼斯  - 你好  麦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello, Jonesey.    - Hello, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.03,0:56:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯  你能坐在这儿真惬意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky I turned up, Jonesey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.99,0:56:39.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面的歌舞让我头都快炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dovchenko there wanted to blow your brains out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.32,0:56:42.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天都三次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the third time  I've saved your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.95,0:56:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,松开手拷  我好给你个大拥抱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unshackle me.  I'll give you a big hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.16,0:56:49.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你当时有手枪啊  为什么束手就擒啊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a Luger pointed at the base of your skull the first time we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.00,0:56:51.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都在我控制之下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the situation under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.96,0:56:54.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你欠我的情  - 那你欠他们什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You owe me.    - What do you owe them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.80,0:56:58.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二战结束后你就叛变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the war, when you turned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.09,0:56:59.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给了苏军多少名单？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how many names did you give the Reds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.34,0:57:02.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又有多少人因为你命丧黄泉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not looking at the big picture here. How many good men died because of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.89,0:57:05.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这帮共军终究会放开我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually, they're gonna let me out of this chair, comrade,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.27,0:57:08.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到时看我怎么打断你鼻子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when they do, I'm going to break your nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.73,0:57:12.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,共军？你以为这是因为意识形态？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Comrade"? You think this is about flags?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.15,0:57:14.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了地图上的线？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About uniforms? You think  this is about lines on a map?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.61,0:57:16.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是为了钱  是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just about money, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.48,0:57:18.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要的才不是钱呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not only money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.36,0:57:23.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是堆积如山的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gigantic pile of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.53,0:57:26.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想想埃克托藏着的宝物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about what the Russians will pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.04,0:57:30.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才看不上苏军付我的小钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing compared to what's at Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一座黄金城  那才是我们的梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An entire city of gold. It's what the conquistadors were after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.88,0:57:41.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  琼斯  我们快发财了 比谁都有钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake, Jonesey, we'd be rich! Richer than Howard Hughes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.63,0:57:44.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一分钱上都沾满了鲜血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood money, every nickel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.22,0:57:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会就此放过你的  哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to see  the angle here, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.51,0:57:49.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放聪明点  做该做的事…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be smart. Do the right thing. Just like in ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.23,0:57:53.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得在柏林吗？懂我的意思没？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like in Berlin. Got me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.90,0:57:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就和在柏林一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like in Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.07,0:57:59.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我出去是吧  去看歌舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to trot off, or should we sing a song?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.49,0:58:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好当初没杀你  琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fortunate our failure  to kill you, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.37,0:58:07.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又为我们服务了一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You survive to be of service to us once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.45,0:58:10.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我的  总是助人为乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know me,  always glad to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.50,0:58:15.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,掌控死亡的力量才会摧毁这世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Now I am become death, the destroyer of worlds."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.92,0:58:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得这些话吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You recognize those words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.76,0:58:23.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出自你们的奥本海默博士  在他制造了原子弹之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was your own Dr. Oppenheimer after he created the atomic bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.26,0:58:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是在引用印度教的圣经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was quoting the Hindu bible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.76,0:58:26.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显是威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nuclear intimidation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.93,0:58:30.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我们唾手可得更高级的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now this next level of weapon is ours to have,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.02,0:58:32.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该轮到你们恐惧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yours to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.02,0:58:35.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,武器？什么样的武器？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon? What weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.61,0:58:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,精神控制武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mind weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.44,0:58:41.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,心理战的阵地  斯大林的梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new frontier of psychic warfare. That was Stalin's dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.95,0:58:47.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我可明白奥力克斯为何要把骷髅放回原处了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I know why Oxley put the  skull back where he found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.08,0:58:49.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道你们在找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew you were looking for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.41,0:58:51.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想必你一见骷髅就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That skull is no mere deity carving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.50,0:58:53.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那简直巧夺天工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely you knew that the moment you laid eyes on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.62,0:58:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝非出自人手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not made by human hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.75,0:58:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁做的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who made it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.76,0:59:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.68,0:59:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在新墨西哥州找到的尸骸不是第一具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The body we found in New Mexico was not the first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.64,0:59:11.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在苏联的几处地方也有相同发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd already dissected two others from similar crash sites in Soviet Union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.60,0:59:13.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火星来客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saucer men from Mars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.43,0:59:15.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于埃克托的古老传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The legends about Akator  are all true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.65,0:59:18.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,古人是想象不出来的  更不要说建造出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Early men could not have  conceived it, much less built it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.15,0:59:20.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一座高等生物的城池{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a city of supreme beings ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.40,0:59:23.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们技术发达  拥有超常能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with technologies and paranormal abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.57,0:59:25.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这玩笑可开大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.03,0:59:29.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看吧  信不信由你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you choose not to believe your own eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.83,0:59:34.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,新墨西哥州找到的样本  让我们充满希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The New Mexico specimen gave us hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.00,0:59:40.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然还有其它样本  骸骨都是由纯水晶制成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike the others we'd found, its skeleton was pure crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.67,0:59:45.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能一同找到埃克托  也许我们要到的是同样的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A distant cousin, perhaps. Maybe they, too, were sent to find Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.93,0:59:49.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们殊途同归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we're all searching for the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.47,0:59:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有别的解释了  - 总会有其它解释的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is no other explanation.    - There's always another explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.14,1:00:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,头骨是公元15世纪从埃克托偷来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skull was stolen from Akator in the 15th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.48,1:00:01.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不论是谁…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever returns it ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.69,1:00:04.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将其归还就能拥有无上的控制力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Returns it to the city temple will gain control over its powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.19,1:00:07.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听过这故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard that bedtime story before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.24,1:00:10.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是传说  你凭什么认为埃克托真正存在？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a legend. Why do you think Akator even existed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.37,1:00:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好拿这问题问问你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should ask your friend that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.00,1:00:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把教授带过来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.87,1:00:15.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定去过那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're certain he's been there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.21,1:00:17.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯利？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.14,1:00:34.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我  印第啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, it's me, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.31,1:00:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.35,1:00:40.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在装疯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, you're faking it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.86,1:00:43.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,透过泪朦朦的双眼我看到…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Through eyes  that last I saw in tears ..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.86,1:00:47.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯  听我说  你是哈洛德·奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, listen to me, pal. Your name is Harold Oxley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.95,1:00:49.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出生于英国利兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were born in Leeds, England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.49,1:00:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩在芝加哥大学是同窗好友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I went to school together at the University of Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.33,1:00:55.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来不曾像今天这样好笑  我叫…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were never this interesting. My name is ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.08,1:00:59.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫小亨利·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Henry Jones, Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.13,1:01:02.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们把他怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.34,1:01:04.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没做  都怪那该死的颅骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't done a thing. It's the bloody skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.67,1:01:07.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士会带我们去埃克托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the divining rod that will lead us to Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.97,1:01:10.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们需要个翻译{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need someone to interpret him for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.47,1:01:15.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他精神状态看来不佳  希望你的精神状态比他好些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mind, it seems, is quite weak. Let's hope yours is stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.93,1:01:22.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水晶骷髅可以刺激大脑中尚不为人知的部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skull's crystal stimulates an undeveloped part of the human brain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.36,1:01:24.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开心灵通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}opening a psychic channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.61,1:01:28.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯就是因为盯着它太久 才丧失了心智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxley lost control of his mind by staring too long into its eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.78,1:01:33.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们坚信  你也这么做就能和他沟通了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe you can get through to  him after you have done the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.45,1:01:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有个更好的办法  不如你来试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a better idea.  You look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.29,1:01:39.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎骷髅头不是同每个人都有交流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skull does not speak  to everyone, it seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.79,1:01:43.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想必不害怕吧 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely you're not afraid,  Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.46,1:01:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你穷尽一生追寻的答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've spent your entire life searching for answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.13,1:01:49.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想想这双眼之后的真相吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of the truth behind those eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.30,1:01:51.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能世上还有数百个这样的骷髅头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There may be hundreds of skulls at Akator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.97,1:01:56.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁找到他们  谁就能掌握有史以来最强大的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever finds them will control  the greatest natural force the world has ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.14,1:02:01.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类心智的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power over the mind of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.77,1:02:05.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心哦  你可能真的会如愿以偿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful, you might get  exactly what you wish for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.48,1:02:06.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我通常都心想事成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I usually do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.18,1:02:42.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.69,1:02:46.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,透过层层防线探知敌军秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To peer across the world and know the enemy's secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.44,1:02:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我们的思想灌输给你们的领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To place our thoughts into the minds of your leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.78,1:02:52.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让老师教授真正的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make your teachers teach the true version of history,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.45,1:02:55.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你们的战士听从我方指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your soldiers attack on our command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.36,1:02:58.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以神游世界  强大无比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be everywhere at once, more powerful than a whisper,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.24,1:03:02.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在睡梦中即可改变世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}invading your dreams, thinking your thoughts for you while you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.75,1:03:07.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会改变你的 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will change you, Dr. Jones,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.71,1:03:10.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们所有人都会由内到外改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all of you, from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.59,1:03:13.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将会变成我们的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will turn you into us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.38,1:03:18.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而最好的一点  你察觉不到这种转变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the best part? You won't even know it's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.56,1:03:21.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.73,1:03:26.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.44,1:03:30.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.74,1:03:37.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 如果他死了 我们到不了那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough. If he dies, we can't get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.03,1:03:39.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,盖起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.54,1:03:45.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.62,1:03:48.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right, Jonesey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.42,1:03:55.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你把我的鼻子打断了  - 告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You broke my nose!    - I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.93,1:04:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 你去和奥克斯谈话  然后带领我们去埃克托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! You will speak to Oxley and lead us to Akator, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.91,1:04:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做梦{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.52,1:04:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.15,1:04:12.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 孩子 你还好吗？ - 这是我最糟的一学期了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right, kid?    - They left my bike at the cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.86,1:04:14.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吧？ - 他们没把我的摩托车带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but you're all right?    - They left my bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.78,1:04:18.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  慢着  慢着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Whoa, whoa. Wait, wait, wait. Stop, stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.50,1:04:30.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了  什么都别给这些猪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready.  Don't give these pigs a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.46,1:04:32.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见他说什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.13,1:04:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 我还不想让他死呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly I have chosen the wrong pressure point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.72,1:04:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我可以找到个更敏感脆弱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I can find a more sensitive one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:40.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把她带出来!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.07,1:04:44.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手拿开  你们这些狗杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands off me, you rotten Russki son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.48,1:04:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indiana Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.23,1:04:54.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你总是个扫把星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About time you showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.69,1:04:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈  - 甜心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom!    - Sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈妈"？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mom"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:04:59.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.82,1:05:01.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说我了  你没受伤吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about me. Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.99,1:05:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- "妈妈"？ - 年轻人  我明明告诉过你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Mom"?  - Young man, I specifically told you ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.33,1:05:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要来这  - 玛丽安是你妈妈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- not to come here.    - Marion is your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.00,1:05:08.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你信里可没讲  电话里也没讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never wrote that. You never  said that in any phone calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.12,1:05:10.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽安·瑞文伍德是你妈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marion Ravenwood is your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.37,1:05:13.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 印第  生个儿子没那么难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake, Indy,  it's not that hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.67,1:05:15.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我的意思是  我从来没认为你…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I mean, I just never thought ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.67,1:05:17.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你离开之后还活得挺好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have a life after you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.34,1:05:19.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这可不是我的意思  - 生活得很滋润{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not what I meant.    - A damn good life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.93,1:05:23.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那就好  - 生活得好的不能再好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that's fine.    - A damn good, really good life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.60,1:05:25.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也是  - 真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, so have I!    - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.18,1:05:26.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是生活在人类遗址里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still leaving a trail of human wreckage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.06,1:05:28.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是退休了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or have you retired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.56,1:05:30.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这样问？想约我吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? You looking for a date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.14,1:05:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约谁都不约你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With anybody but you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.48,1:05:36.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 琼斯博士  你会帮我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Dr. Jones, you will help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.11,1:05:37.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说行就可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A simple "yes" will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.65,1:05:40.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽安  你为什么跑去让人家绑架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Marion, you had to go and get yourself kidnapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.20,1:05:42.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也没做什么好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like you did any better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.95,1:05:45.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是老样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same old, same old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.95,1:05:50.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小亨利·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry Jones, Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.83,1:05:55.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小亨利·琼斯  - 没错  是我 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Henry Jones, Jr. ...    - That's right, Ox. Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.42,1:05:58.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双手放在金钥匙上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To lay their just hands on that Golden Key ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.51,1:06:01.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打开永恒之殿的大门  - 什么宫殿…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "that ope's the Palace of Eternity."    - Palace of ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.43,1:06:03.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说过这句话  什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from Milton. He's said it before. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.01,1:06:06.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯  你得告诉我们怎么去埃克托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, you got to tell us how to get to Akator ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.60,1:06:08.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不然他们会杀了玛丽安的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or they're gonna kill Marion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.10,1:06:12.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,透过泪朦朦的双眼看见金色图像重现…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Through eyes that last I saw in tears, here in death's dream kingdom ..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.52,1:06:15.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈洛德  他们会杀掉安不勒的小女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harold, they're gonna kill Abner's little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.15,1:06:18.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们怎么去那儿  我需要详细…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to tell us how to get there. We need ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.12,1:06:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我张纸  随便什么能写字的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me paper.  Something to write with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.08,1:06:28.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快拿张纸来!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.09,1:06:41.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他画下来  早该料到这一点的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autowriting!  I should have seen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.76,1:06:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小亨利·琼斯  - 没错  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Henry Jones, Jr.    - Right. That's right, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.47,1:06:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往下落三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three times it drops.  The way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.40,1:06:57.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 3次…  - 象形文字记载？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three times ...    - Pictographs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.61,1:07:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,象形文字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ideograms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.74,1:07:11.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  奥克斯  很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, Ox. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.55,1:07:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.39,1:07:28.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.35,1:07:33.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是马特  看着我  看着我  是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mutt, Ox. Hey, look at me. Look at me. It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.56,1:07:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.27,1:07:44.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弯曲的线条绝对代表河水  紧闭的双眼代表睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wavy lines mean water, of course. Closed eyes mean sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.28,1:07:48.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,空中闪烁的太阳表示时刻  时期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun with the arc over the sky stands for time, duration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.66,1:07:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"现在"这个词表示"直到"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word "now" is "until."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.33,1:07:52.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紧挨的两条蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These two close together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:56.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昂起身子是一个神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the horizon and the snake, mean one thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.17,1:07:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地平线代表世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The horizon stood for the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.25,1:08:01.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个代表"巨大的"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it didn't mean the Earth. It meant big, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.84,1:08:07.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长眠于巨蛇下的大河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The water sleeps until the great snake."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.68,1:08:10.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不仅仅是图画  而是方位  给我张地图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These aren't just drawings, they're directions. Get me a map!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.72,1:08:11.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地图!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.10,1:08:17.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大蛇是亚马孙河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great snake is the Amazon, of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.14,1:08:20.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,睡觉？哪条河会睡觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but "sleep," what water sleeps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.24,1:08:27.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿 索拿河  葡萄牙语里是"睡眠"的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here! Sono. The Portuguese word for "sleep."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.74,1:08:29.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  的确是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, good. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.03,1:08:35.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,色法罗河在此处转弯  与索拿河交汇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants us to follow this curve of the Sono ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:39.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在东南方与亚马逊交汇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down to where it meets the Amazon to the southeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.33,1:08:41.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其余的我就不确定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.21,1:08:45.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,王国  梦境  眼泪  双眼… 不知到底什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kingdom of dreams, tears and eyes ... I have no idea what he means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.71,1:08:46.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但也可能指的是路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be the route, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.80,1:08:49.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿人烟罕至  属于卡锐兵平原{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a completely unexplored part of the canopy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.56,1:08:55.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑  快  快  快  快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go, go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.23,1:09:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们到底在干嘛  小子？ - 他们会杀死我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kid, what the hell are we doing, kid?    - They were going to kill us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.48,1:09:06.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许吧  - 得有人采取措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, maybe.    - Somebody had to do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.82,1:09:09.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 其它的措施还好些  - 至少我有个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something else would have been good.    - At least I got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.20,1:09:12.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可理喻  哈洛德  跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is intolerable. Harold, for God's sake, keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.75,1:09:21.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.83,1:09:24.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别过来  - 停下  别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay back!    - Stop! Stop! Stop! Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:26.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乱动会形成空间  导致下沉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving makes space, space will make you sink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.42,1:09:27.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把腿拔出来…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think I can get out  if I can just ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.76,1:09:29.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动 往外拔只会更糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! You're pulling against a vacuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.43,1:09:31.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like trying to lift a car. Just stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.34,1:09:32.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我不慌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.60,1:09:33.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了？流沙？ - 我冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? Quicksand?    - I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.97,1:09:35.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不对  是干沙  - 我在下沉  但我冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it's a dry sand pit.    - I'm sinking, but I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.06,1:09:38.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,流沙混合了沙  水和泥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quicksand is a mix of sand, mud and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.14,1:09:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,基于粘性  它并不像人们想得那么危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And depending on the viscosity, it's not as dangerous as people sometimes think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.74,1:09:41.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看在老天的份上  琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Pete's sake, Jones,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.48,1:09:43.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是在学校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're not in school!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.15,1:09:46.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  没什么好担心的  除非…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. There's nothing to worry about unless there's a ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.94,1:09:49.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样才麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A void collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.11,1:09:53.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿东西救你们出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go get something  to pull you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.49,1:09:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯 别傻站着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, don't just sit there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.45,1:09:58.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看在上帝的面上 老兄 找人来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake, man, go get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.04,1:10:01.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救命  - 帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help?    - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.21,1:10:02.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.79,1:10:04.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去找人帮忙  去呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.25,1:10:09.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马特可能有些冲动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutt can be a little impetuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.67,1:10:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不算是世上最坏的性质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the worst quality  in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.80,1:10:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双手上举  那小子回来的时候  抓住递来的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your arms above the surface. When the kid comes back, grab on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.80,1:10:18.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 印第  他是…  - 他是个好孩子  玛丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Indy, he ...    - He's a good kid, Marion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.97,1:10:20.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别再拿学习唠叨他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should get off his back about school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:22.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 马特  我是说…  - 他救了大伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mutt, I mean ...    - Not everybody's cut out for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.90,1:10:24.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他名叫亨利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Henry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.65,1:10:26.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利  好名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry. Good name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.27,1:10:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.82,1:10:31.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.49,1:10:33.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亨利·琼斯  三世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry Jones the Third.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.53,1:10:40.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么没逼他完成学业？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell didn't you  make him finish school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.50,1:10:43.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈 抓好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, grab on! Grab it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.25,1:10:44.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.79,1:10:48.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 老妈 拉  使劲儿拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mom!  Pull, pull, pull, pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.05,1:10:50.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.26,1:10:54.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓着呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.35,1:10:59.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抓住  - 抓住那蛇  印第{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grab it.    - Just grab it, Indy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.18,1:11:00.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它只吃老鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a rat snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.81,1:11:02.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吃老鼠的蛇没这么大  - 这只就这么大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rat snakes aren't that big.    - Well, this one is, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.85,1:11:04.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没毒的  抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not even poisonous.  Now grab on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.52,1:11:07.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去拿别的东西  - 拿什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go get something else.    - Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.15,1:11:08.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绳子之类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a rope or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.98,1:11:12.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿可找不到绳子  抓住蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no Sears and Roebuck here! Grab the snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.57,1:11:17.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许我就能触到底了  - 不会到底的  抓着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I can touch the bottom.    - There's no bottom. Now grab it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.87,1:11:19.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我脚尖已触到底了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think  I can feel it with my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.87,1:11:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抓着蛇  - 别那样喊它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grab the snake!    - Stop calling it that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.58,1:11:24.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是条蛇  要我怎么叫？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a snake! What do you want me to call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.37,1:11:26.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 叫"绳子"  - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say "rope."    - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:28.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说"抓住绳子"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say "grab the rope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:31.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抓着绳子  - 抓着绳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grab the rope!    - Grab the rope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.13,1:11:33.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight. It's slimy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.92,1:11:35.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扯啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.47,1:11:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,儿子 把它扔远点好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of that thing, will you, Son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.73,1:11:47.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid of snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.94,1:11:50.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个疯老头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one crazy old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.78,1:11:58.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你下一步准备干什么啊  琼斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you have to do everything the hard way, Jonesey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.08,1:12:04.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮啊  奥克斯  谢谢啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work, Ox. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.83,1:12:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找人帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.82,1:12:44.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  他是英国人  我老爸是皇家空军飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, he was British. My dad was an RAF pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.12,1:12:46.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是战斗英雄  不是什么大学老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a war hero, not some schoolteacher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.50,1:12:50.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  甜心  柯林是你的继父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sweetheart. Colin was your stepfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.29,1:12:52.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你3个月大时  我才和他约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We started dating when you were three months old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.17,1:12:53.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.63,1:12:57.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 柯林？是那个柯林·威廉姆斯吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait. Colin? As in Colin Williams? You ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.01,1:13:01.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和他结婚了？是我介绍你们认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You married him? I introduced you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.64,1:13:04.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你管我最后嫁给谁呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you gave up your vote on who I married ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.81,1:13:07.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼前一周你和我分手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you decided to break it off a week before the wedding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.81,1:13:10.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我俩都清楚  咱们的婚姻不会幸福的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we both knew, Marion, it wasn't going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.23,1:13:12.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你才不知道呢  不然怎么没跟我说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't know that. Why didn't  you ever talk to me about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.77,1:13:14.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为每一次吵架都是你赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we never had an argument I won!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.73,1:13:16.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你回不上嘴可不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault  if you can't keep up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.57,1:13:17.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤了你的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to hurt you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.82,1:13:20.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天慈悲  闭嘴吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For love of God, shut the hell up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.53,1:13:24.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就从来没觉得奇怪为何几年前奥克斯不理你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you ever wonder years ago why Ox stopped talking to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.62,1:13:26.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他恨你离我而去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hated that you ran away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.41,1:13:27.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个别吵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you two just stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.91,1:13:31.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  玛丽安  别让小孩子看见爹妈吵架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Marion, let's not let  the kid see mom and dad fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.58,1:13:33.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不是我爹  明白吗？ - 我是你爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not my dad, okay?    - You bet I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.84,1:13:35.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I got news for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.25,1:13:37.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得回学校完成学业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna go back  and finish school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.34,1:13:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? What happened to,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.59,1:13:40.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There's not a damn thing wrong with it, kid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.18,1:13:42.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"做自己喜欢的事"之类的话了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and don't let anybody else tell you any different"? You don't remember saying that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.89,1:13:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在我知道你是我儿子之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was before I was your father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.68,1:13:46.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你才不是我爹!  - 没错  他是你爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not my father!    - Oh, yes, he is your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.22,1:13:47.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把孩子的事告诉我  玛丽安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have told me about the kid, Marion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.81,1:13:49.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有权知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a right to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.14,1:13:50.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,分手后你无影无踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You vanished after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.89,1:13:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有写信啊  - 一年之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wrote.    - A year later!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.52,1:13:57.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到信时  马特已经出生  我也结婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By then, Mutt was born and I was married!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.40,1:13:59.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你何必现在费事告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you bothering  to tell me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.28,1:14:01.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我认为我们快死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I thought we were gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.70,1:14:02.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.42,1:14:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.05,1:14:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.73,1:14:39.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢肯定我不是你的唯一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I wasn't the only one to go on with my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.53,1:14:42.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年来你一定有不少红颜知己吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must've been plenty of  women for you over the years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.57,1:14:46.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是有几个  但是全有一样的毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. There were a few, but they all had the same problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么毛病？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.83,1:14:52.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们不是你  亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.02,1:15:19.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要抢在他们之前找到骷髅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get Oxley back, get our hands on that skull ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.19,1:15:22.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后送到埃克托  抓住方向盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get to Akator before they do. Grab the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.12,1:15:36.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he gonna do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.33,1:15:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不觉得他有那么长远的计划  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think he plans that far ahead.    - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.59,1:15:42.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 往右边挪挪好吗  儿子？ - 别叫我"儿子"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scooch over, will you, Son?    - Don't call me "son." Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.05,1:15:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是我  就堵住耳朵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'd cover my ears  if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.81,1:15:57.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,低头  低头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duck! Duck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.82,1:16:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.70,1:16:06.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那个博士身边停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up next to that duck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.79,1:16:18.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小亨利·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry Jones, Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.26,1:16:22.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.36,1:16:24.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个带走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.85,1:16:32.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.33,1:16:37.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拦住他!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.61,1:16:49.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快 来这辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.59,1:17:05.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卧倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.77,1:17:20.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯拿着骷髅呢  玛丽安握好方向盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox has got the skull. Marion, take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.81,1:17:22.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又让她开车？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not fair.  She drove the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.23,1:17:25.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别孩子气  找武器和他们打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a child. Find something to fight with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.08,1:17:36.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.68,1:17:51.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 琼斯  - 你好啊 麦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jonesey!    - Hi, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.00,1:18:30.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 印第 印第  - 闭嘴  闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Indy. Indy! Indy!    - Shut up! Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.22,1:18:35.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这愚蠢的狗杂种  我是中情局的  - 中情局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You stupid son of a bitch! I'm CIA.    - CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.35,1:18:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要你死  就像在柏林时一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost screamed it at you in the tent. I said, "Just like Berlin."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.06,1:18:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在柏林干嘛  兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were we in Berlin, mate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.10,1:18:42.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 双面间谍  - 把骷髅头扔给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Double agents!    - The skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.02,1:18:48.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住那包袱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw me the skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.67,1:19:11.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,注意姿势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riposte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.30,1:19:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双脚别站那么开  注意姿势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on your front foot. Riposte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.51,1:19:21.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是比赛  老妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a match, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.38,1:19:51.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打架就是个新手  打得快 输得也快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fight like a young man, eager to begin, quick to finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.88,1:19:53.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马特  别和她纠缠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutt, disengage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.92,1:20:35.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到骷髅了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, I got the skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.51,1:20:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 扔过来  - 扔过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Throw the bag! Throw it!    - Throw the bag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.30,1:20:39.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 枪  - 小心枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gun!    - Gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.31,1:21:29.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看什么看  她就要逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at, Daddy-o? She's getting away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.93,1:22:12.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到那边去{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.04,1:22:30.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.07,1:23:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了  琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do svidanya, Dr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.26,1:23:29.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.28,1:23:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拐弯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.44,1:24:17.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 食人蚁  - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Siafu.    - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.85,1:24:19.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃人的蚂蚁 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big damn ants! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.20,1:24:35.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去河边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run to the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.42,1:24:43.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他们{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.18,1:24:56.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带着骷髅往河边跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.94,1:25:08.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上车  快快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump in! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.83,1:25:15.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈  那儿有悬崖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, there's a cliff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.74,1:28:03.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 琼斯  快来!  - 琼斯 上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jonesey, come on!    - Get in, Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.85,1:28:22.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈 停下  - 快减速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom, stop.    - Mom, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.06,1:28:27.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停下 亲爱的  - 快减速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey, stop.    - Slow down, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.31,1:28:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要开下悬崖了  - 我自有办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna go off the cliff.    - That's the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.06,1:28:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但不是什么好办法  我来  - 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bad idea. Give me the wheel.    - Trust me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.73,1:28:33.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.76,1:29:04.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再也不要那么干了  - 好的 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't ever do that again.    - Yes, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.53,1:29:17.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往下落三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three times it drops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.45,1:29:24.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,倒车  转过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reverse. Put it in reverse!  Full reverse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.12,1:29:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在尝试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying! I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.18,1:29:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下去的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.65,1:29:53.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,陆地上的那条道  你是说从陆地上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He means by land.  He came by land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.32,1:29:58.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 往下落三次？ - 往下落三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three times it drops?    - Three times it drops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.65,1:30:00.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.11,1:30:01.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的意思是第一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He means one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.53,1:30:05.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是第二次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.01,1:30:25.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.21,1:31:02.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？松手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay? Babe? Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.97,1:31:05.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,透过泪朦朦的双眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Through eyes that last I saw in tears."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.01,1:31:10.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看见金色图像重现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The golden vision reappears!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.90,1:31:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金子 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold. I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.98,1:31:20.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,透过双眼…泪朦朦的双眼  我们得穿过瀑布{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through eyes ... Through eyes in tears. We got to go through that waterfall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.65,1:31:26.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须归还骷髅  我去吧  其它人不必来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skull has to be returned. I'll do it. Nobody else has to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.57,1:31:28.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁在乎？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.83,1:31:31.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它只能给我们带来麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's brought us nothing but trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.79,1:31:34.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看把他变成什么样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what it did to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.33,1:31:37.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我必须得去归还  - 为什么是你去？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have to return it.    - Why you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.59,1:31:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为它告诉我要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it told me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.43,1:31:56.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 欧克斯人  他们的图腾  壁画  - 欧克斯  别走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ochre, iron oxide, charcoal.    - Oxy, stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.94,1:31:58.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这有多久的历史了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.65,1:32:01.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四五千年前的文明  与金字塔一样古老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four or five thousand years. Old as the pyramids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.53,1:32:05.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崇拜太阳神的人  和埃及人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sun worshippers, like the Egyptians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.62,1:32:11.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是新鲜的  刚刚有人用过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is fresh.  These were just used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.80,1:32:27.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更多的崇拜者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More worshippers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.59,1:32:30.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但他们不崇拜太阳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but that's not the sun they're worshipping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.98,1:32:38.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone came ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.61,1:32:44.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,农耕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and taught the Ugha farming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.86,1:32:50.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,灌溉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irrigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.71,1:33:02.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯  怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.44,1:33:21.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你的意思  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I understand, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.11,1:33:25.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人来过？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone came?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.59,1:33:51.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那骷髅头和壁画中的一模一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they the same?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.18,1:33:53.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不止一个  看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were more. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.93,1:33:58.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一共有十三个  围成一圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirteen in a circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.07,1:34:07.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,路在哪儿  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show us the way, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.45,1:35:00.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们走  快  快  - 快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. Go, go, go! Run! Run, go!    - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.99,1:35:32.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.82,1:35:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小琼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.49,1:35:36.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.95,1:35:40.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到过这里  怎么逃脱的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were here before. How did you get past them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.63,1:35:55.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起来  麦克  起来  麦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mac. Come on! Come on, Mac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.51,1:35:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快来  来  来  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.68,1:36:01.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双手放在金钥匙上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To lay their just hands on that Golden Key ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.18,1:36:02.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打开永恒宫殿的大门  - 来吧  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "that ope's the Palace of Eternity."    - Come on, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.89,1:36:04.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好样儿的  你是好样儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did good, Ox. You did good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.38,1:36:31.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黄金之城  那黄金在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}City of gold.  So where's all the gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.84,1:36:34.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这地方有多老了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the state of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢透了  真是浪费我的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a stupid legend. What a waste of my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.68,1:36:42.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯从前来过这里  但他没法子进入神殿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox was here before, but he  couldn't get into the temple,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.56,1:36:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他就又把骷髅送了回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he took the skull back to the cemetery, where he found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.19,1:36:50.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的双手放在纯金钥匙上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To lay their just hands on that Golden Key ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.69,1:36:52.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用来打开永恒宫殿的大门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"that ope's the Palace of Eternity."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.07,1:36:55.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宫殿金钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key that ope's the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.90,1:36:59.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,石碑! 这石碑就是钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The obelisk.  The obelisk is the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.08,1:37:09.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯  你找什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking for, Ox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.63,1:37:13.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.26,1:37:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在监牢里才想明白  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You figured this out in your cell, didn't you, Professor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.89,1:37:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我试一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.74,1:37:41.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.28,1:37:43.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去搬你自己的石块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.18,1:38:44.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.06,1:38:47.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.98,1:38:52.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闪开  奥克斯  快走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Move! Ox, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.02,1:39:01.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.20,1:39:02.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.86,1:39:05.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙  快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not good. Move, Ox! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.78,1:39:07.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Quick! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.04,1:39:12.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌这样  我讨厌这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like this!  I don't like it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.75,1:39:14.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈 快点  - 琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom, come on!    - Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.06,1:39:34.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞丢了  他把骷髅搞丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He dropped it.  He dropped the skull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.48,1:39:35.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.07,1:39:47.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.87,1:39:52.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克斯  你没受伤吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ox, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.73,1:39:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.71,1:40:00.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  咱们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.59,1:40:08.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走这边？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.00,1:41:18.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于看见点值钱的东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's more like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.05,1:41:27.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各个历史时期的文物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are artifacts from every era of early history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.05,1:41:30.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马其顿文明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Macedonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.34,1:41:32.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 苏美尔文明  - 这简直就是天然的收藏展览{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sumerian.    - This place is the mother lode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.01,1:41:34.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴比伦文明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Etruscan. Babylonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.06,1:41:39.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世界上的每个博物馆都会爱死这地方的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't a museum in the world that  wouldn't sell its soul for this lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.27,1:41:40.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早期的埃及文明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Early Egyptian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.44,1:41:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,许多许多博物馆  成千上百个  琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dozens of museums. Hundreds of them, Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.27,1:41:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收藏家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collectors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.20,1:41:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是考古学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were archeologists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.78,1:42:29.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么打开它？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we open it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.91,1:42:38.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它还回去  奥克斯  我承诺过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give it back, Ox. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.49,1:44:00.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用再永远等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more forever waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.50,1:44:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.92,1:44:14.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起了  琼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Jonesey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.93,1:44:17.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底为谁工作？三重特务？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what are you, a triple agent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.68,1:44:21.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里  说我是双重特务  不过是谎话而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, I just lied  about being a double.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.35,1:44:28.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.19,1:44:34.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仍然在等待迷失的那个回归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still waiting for the return of the one who was lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.20,1:44:41.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然作为个体存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are a hive mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.08,1:44:47.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却心灵相通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One being physically separate, but with a collective consciousness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.54,1:44:53.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,合而为一力量会更大  远胜于个体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More powerful together than they can ever be apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.81,1:45:04.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下  他们能够告诉什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine what they could tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.52,1:45:06.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想不出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.31,1:45:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,建造神殿的人也想不出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither could the humans that built this temple,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.89,1:45:08.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更不用说是你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and neither can you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.06,1:45:12.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我吧 琼斯博士  你在这儿会收到一份礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belief, Dr. Jones, is a gift you have yet to receive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.11,1:45:15.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sympathies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.74,1:45:19.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这点我相信  所以才到这地下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I believe, sister. That's why I'm down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.19,1:45:57.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛雅语  他在说玛雅语  - 他在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mayan. He's speaking Mayan.    - What does he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.53,1:46:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说  非常感激  他想要…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says he's grateful  and he wants ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.32,1:46:03.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.79,1:46:10.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想要给我们一份礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wants to give us a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.46,1:46:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丰厚的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A big gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.63,1:46:19.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你所知道的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me everything you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.80,1:46:25.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道一切  我想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know everything. I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.81,1:46:36.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我预感不妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.99,1:46:42.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,印第{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.16,1:46:44.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看他们的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.10,1:47:50.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是什么东西？航天员？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they? Spacemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.22,1:47:54.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要回自己的空间去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interdimensional beings,  in point of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.73,1:47:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你终于清醒了  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, Ox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.95,1:48:09.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.70,1:48:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通往另一个空间的通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A portal! A pathway to another dimension!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.96,1:48:16.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才不要去呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think we want  to go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.10,1:48:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道  我想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know. I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.60,1:48:41.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我  我准备好了  我想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me. I'm ready.  I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.53,1:48:50.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克  麦克  快来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac! Mac! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.29,1:48:57.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别拿了  现在就走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac, damn it, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.85,1:49:12.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能看见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.18,1:49:15.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.60,1:49:19.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.69,1:49:27.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往上爬啊  麦克  我一个人拉不动你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use your legs, Mac.  I can't do it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.41,1:49:30.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  小琼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonesey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.28,1:49:34.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.96,1:49:44.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.67,1:49:49.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,盖上它  快盖上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover it. Cover it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.32,1:50:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.48,1:50:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.25,1:50:22.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.10,1:52:45.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那痕迹像朵花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a broom to their footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.19,1:52:51.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们上哪儿去了？太空？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did they go? Space?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.40,1:52:57.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是去了太空  而是空间的缝隙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not into space. Into the space between spaces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.37,1:53:08.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.75,1:53:12.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,传说中的黄金城在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why this legend of a city of gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.75,1:53:15.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在古语中黄金这个词可译成"宝藏"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ugha word for gold translates as "treasure."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.93,1:53:20.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但宝物指的并非是黄金  而是知识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But their treasure wasn't gold. It was knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.93,1:53:23.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知识才是他们的宝物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowledge was their treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.86,1:53:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道我们就坐在这儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? We're just going to sit here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.24,1:53:42.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  雨林的夜晚来的早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night falls quick in the jungle, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.99,1:53:44.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想摸黑翻山越岭吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to climb down the mountain in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.99,1:53:46.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.50,1:53:51.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能  跟着我走  来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can. Who's coming with me? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.08,1:53:54.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何不坐一会儿呢 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you stick around, Junior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.09,1:53:59.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  你为什么不走呢  老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Why didn't you, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.14,1:54:02.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.22,1:54:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.52,1:54:15.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爷爷不定在哪儿偷笑呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere your grandpa is laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.05,1:54:31.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(小亨利·琼斯教授 副院长)
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.79,1:54:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  棒极了  把字写大点儿 再大点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marvelous! Perfect! Make the  letters bigger, much bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.22,1:54:51.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小亨利·琼斯和玛丽安·瑞文伍德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry Jones, Jr., and Marion Ravenwood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.06,1:54:57.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你二人愿意在此神圣仪式上宣布今后共结连理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}insomuch in that you two have agreed to live together in holy matrimony,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.15,1:55:00.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宣誓彼此珍爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have promised your love for  each other by these vows ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.45,1:55:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,执对方之手  交换戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the joining of your hands and the giving of these rings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.87,1:55:06.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在宣布你们结成夫妻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now declare you to be husband and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.66,1:55:12.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奉上帝之意结合  永不分离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whom God hath put together, let no one tear asunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.46,1:55:15.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人生有多少时光都在等待中虚度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"How much of human life is lost in waiting!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.54,1:55:18.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.88,1:55:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以吻新娘子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may kiss your bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.57,1:55:43.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错  亨利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Henry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.36,1:55:45.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  奥克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Ox.{\r}
